WEBVTT

00:01:36.550 --> 00:01:39.780
We're in the middle 
of a brutal heatwave!

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:41.460
And what's this?

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:44.720
Looks like Lee and the 
gang are suffering, too.

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:54.030
So hot... I can't even sleep at night...

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:57.320
Air conditioning... We need A/C...

00:01:57.320 --> 00:02:00.400
We're a sorry group of ninjas 
if we need to rely on A/C!

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:02.200
Neji's right.

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:04.520
We should solve this like real ninjas!

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:06.430
With wind-style jutsu!

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:13.040
Hey, this is pretty refreshing!

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:14.640
Nice work!

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:15.940
But this mist...

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:20.070
Ew, it's sweat!

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:21.870
Cut it out!

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:23.680
This isn't ninjutsu!

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:25.200
Jutsu like that don't exist!

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:27.800
You're getting everyone worked up!

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:32.290
Enough already!

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:40.210
We just need to beg Guy Sensei 
to let us turn on the air—

00:02:40.210 --> 00:02:40.880
Denied.

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:45.930
There are countless ways to cool
off without air conditioning.

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:47.640
That outfit... Don't tell me...

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:50.350
Oh yes, a summer ghost story.

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:52.600
Tonight we'll all tell scary stories,

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:54.980
and send chills down 
everyone else's spines!

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:59.570
I call it my, "I swear it really
happened," ghost story training!

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:02.490
What?! Ghost story training?!

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:03.560
Nice.

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:05.120
Stay down!

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:06.260
Sorry.

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:16.840
<b>A Hot Night for a Chilling Tale</b>

00:03:22.170 --> 00:03:23.390
Okay, we'll start with you Lee.

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:28.390
Tell us a tale so chilling it 
will make our teeth chatter!

00:03:29.030 --> 00:03:30.160
Very well.

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:33.970
I will tell you all the gory
details of something...

00:03:33.970 --> 00:03:37.230
...that happened to me just the other day.

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:42.820
A story centered around a particular...

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:45.030
...video tape.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:46.980
Eek!

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:49.250
Shut up!

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:55.960
Is it a tape where you die 
one week after you watch it?

00:03:57.450 --> 00:03:59.430
No, that's kid's stuff.

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:07.160
The horrors I endured were...
much, much scarier.

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:16.360
It was a dark and stormy night,

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:18.490
and I had finally gotten
around to cleaning my room.

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:26.970
I came across a very old VHS 
tape in the back of my closet.

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:28.290
<i>Wh-What's?</i>

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:34.330
A foreboding feeling 
crept into my heart.

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:37.420
There was no mistaking it.

00:04:38.430 --> 00:04:40.750
That tape...

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:49.010
<b>Make-Out Special</b>

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:48.210
...was one I rented over three years
ago and still hadn't returned!

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:54.810
The late fees are going to bankrupt me!

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:58.410
Just thinking about it terrifies me!

00:04:58.410 --> 00:05:01.010
That's not the kind of 
scary we're looking for...

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:02.730
It wasn't?

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:04.780
Lemme see...

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:06.420
Joke book?

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:15.030
That night, I finally got around 
to cleaning the fridge.

00:05:15.030 --> 00:05:17.210
Suddenly, deep in the crisper drawer,

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:19.170
I saw a year-old potato!

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:22.930
Wrong again!

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:24.930
You don't think that's scary?

00:05:24.930 --> 00:05:26.520
Of course not!

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:28.970
Tenten, I don't think you understand.

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:33.020
Do you have any idea how terrifying 
a year-old potato looks?

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:39.310
Have you seen one? Have you?!
It's all wriggly and squishy and yucky—

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:41.680
It's still not the right kind of scary!

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:45.070
We need ghosts and monsters and stuff!

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:47.110
Exactly, Lee.

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:50.610
Just because it scares you 
doesn't make it a ghost story!

00:05:50.610 --> 00:05:53.600
You're next, Naruto. 
Tell us your story.

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:56.580
A-All right...

00:05:57.700 --> 00:06:00.320
Just thinking about it freaks me out...

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:03.590
But I had a really 
scary experience once.

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:09.620
It was late at night and I 
had to hit the bathroom.

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:18.560
Suddenly, I heard a sad voice, 
moaning in pain.

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:28.650
Slowly, I turned and 
looked out the window...

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:34.620
And I saw tears streaming down
the old Third Hokage's face!

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:39.890
That's my story.

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:41.990
How was that? Pretty freaky, right?

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:44.220
Oh, that was me.

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:46.300
Actually, that night...

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:52.260
My training was 10,000 
pull-ups on Mount Hokage.

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:54.960
Boy, was that painful!

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:56.650
I was sweating buckets.

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:58.730
It was just your grunts and sweat?

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:02.370
You fail! That was no 
scary ghost story!

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:04.070
Next is Konohamaru!

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:05.760
Finally.

00:07:05.760 --> 00:07:08.150
I've got a real scary 
story for everyone.

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:14.160
<b>Grand Opening</b>

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:13.260
It was the day we all went to
that new curry restaurant.

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:17.710
Only three of us went in,

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:21.080
but for some reason they 
served us four plates!

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:24.670
Then, there was someone 
invisible sitting next to you?

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:26.740
A g-g-ghost?!

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:28.820
Get off me.

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:30.130
Oh, whoops.

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:33.400
I accidentally put in four orders.

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:34.800
It was you again?!

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:37.530
Sorry, I'm afraid that's 
not a ghost story either.

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:38.930
You're up, Sakura.

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:44.110
Mine's not actually a story,
 but look at this.

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:51.820
It's a picture of us the 
day we went to the beach.

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:55.450
A picture of a spirit?

00:07:56.550 --> 00:07:59.490
Oh, sorry, that was just me farting!

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:02.500
You actually fart visible clouds?!

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:06.640
So that's what that smell was!

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:08.460
Is everything Bushy-Brows' fault?

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:10.540
So much for scary stories,

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:13.500
this is turning into another comedy act.

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:17.180
Your turn, Tenten. Let us have it!

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:21.720
This didn't happen to me,

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:24.480
but Lady Tsunade once told me a story...

00:08:26.990 --> 00:08:30.320
In the girl's bathroom on
the third floor of the Academy,

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:33.510
there is a row of mirrors.

00:08:34.730 --> 00:08:39.060
At 3:33 AM, if you look into 
the third mirror from the back,

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:45.280
you'll see a face 
other than your own.

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:51.920
Is that true?!

00:08:52.490 --> 00:08:55.710
A-A-A real ghost?!

00:08:55.710 --> 00:08:58.290
Was it you again, Lee?

00:08:58.290 --> 00:09:00.910
Oh no. Even for me, that's too much.

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:03.380
I don't go hanging around in girl's 
bathrooms in the wee hours.

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:04.060
What?!

00:09:08.370 --> 00:09:11.210
Then it was a real spirit?

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:17.390
Good timing.

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:19.670
It's almost 3:33 right now.

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:22.760
How about a test of courage?

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:28.560
We should really go back.

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:31.970
It is pretty creepy being 
in the school at night.

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:37.630
Creepy as it is,
it's still hot as heck.

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:41.310
Yeah, all this running around 
just makes it worse.

00:09:52.390 --> 00:09:53.230
Wh-What?!

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:55.960
Sorry, that's just me sweating again.

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:57.490
Why do you sweat so much?!

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:02.160
This is the girl's bathroom.

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:04.830
We'd better use the Sexy 
Jutsu before we go in.

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:07.620
That's quite unnecessary.

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:13.220
The third mirror from the back.

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:16.590
You really think we'll see 
someone else in the mirror?

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:19.410
Go check it out, Naruto.

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:22.100
No, no, no way.

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:27.020
Don't chicken out now. 
It's almost 3:33!

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:29.280
Stop it! I don't wanna!

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:35.290
Well, it's just us.

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:38.700
Guess it was just a tall tale...

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:40.700
But Lady Tsunade was sure 
she saw something...

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:42.160
Lady Tsunade?

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:47.020
Eureka!

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:49.360
Lady Tsunade must've 
gone to the bathroom,

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:52.790
and caught a glimpse of her 
own face without any makeup!

00:10:56.890 --> 00:11:00.840
What was that about my face?!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:03.060
L-Lady Tsunade?!

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:04.300
It's real!

00:11:10.320 --> 00:11:15.230
<i>I-I definitely see a face 
other than my own now...</i>

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:20.640
Well, so much for the ghost story.

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:23.500
Humans are the scariest 
creatures of them all.

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:26.630
Guess there's no such thing 
as ghosts after all.

00:11:26.630 --> 00:11:29.000
You're the only one left, Neji.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.870
R-Right...

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:31.910
That's right.

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:34.340
Okay, Neji, you're our last hope.

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:39.050
Tell us a terrifying tale that 
will chill us to the bone!

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:41.010
Y-Yes...

00:11:42.270 --> 00:11:45.130
<i>I really need to nail it,</i>

00:11:45.130 --> 00:11:48.440
<i>but I don't know any 
really scary stories,</i>

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:49.870
<i>and why would I?</i>

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:51.480
<i>What should I say?</i>

00:11:52.320 --> 00:11:53.570
You can do it!

00:11:58.610 --> 00:11:59.940
Go for it, Neji.

00:12:00.890 --> 00:12:01.760
Everyone...

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:05.030
<i>That's it.
 I've got one!</i>

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:08.250
<i>But should I really tell them?</i>

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:12.050
<i>There'd be no taking it back...</i>

00:12:12.550 --> 00:12:15.180
<i>No, this is no time to waver.</i>

00:12:15.180 --> 00:12:17.070
<i>I need to be strong!</i>

00:12:20.390 --> 00:12:24.390
This is the story about a wolf-man
that I was told as a child...

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:27.470
Wolf-man?

00:12:30.320 --> 00:12:32.620
Once, on the night of the full moon...

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:39.280
A man with wild, unkempt hair

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:41.560
took a comb from his pocket, and howled...

00:12:45.690 --> 00:12:47.630
"I'm shedding!"

00:12:47.630 --> 00:12:52.930
<i>I'm shedding!</i>

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:53.990
So cold...

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.750
And thus, Neji's noble 
sacrifice on this...

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:01.220
...sweltering night left everyone 
frozen for just a moment.

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:03.490
Don't pun-nish me!

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:15.660
Summer is the season for adventures.

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:17.120
With each season and each adventure,

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:20.570
young boys climb the 
steps towards manhood.

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:29.280
My dream is to become the 
youngest Hokage in history.

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:47.380
<b>The Hokage's Tears aren't for Decoration</b>

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:51.270
Pop quiz, everyone!

00:13:51.270 --> 00:13:52.740
In the first half of the episode,

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:57.190
it seemed Lee was behind all the scary
happenings in everyone's ghost stories.

00:13:57.190 --> 00:14:00.680
But actually, one phenomenon was real.

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:04.860
Did you notice?

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:07.380
The answer... is right 
in front of you!

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:08.540
Here, look closely.

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:12.320
Lee was doing pull-ups on 
the First Hokage's eye,

00:14:12.320 --> 00:14:13.790
but Naruto said...

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:19.250
<i>I saw tears streaming down 
the old Third Hokage's face!</i>

00:14:19.870 --> 00:14:23.170
So the monument was actually crying?

00:14:23.510 --> 00:14:26.990
I remember "The Tears of Mount Hokage"

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:28.690
was one of the "Seven 
Mysteries of the Leaf"

00:14:28.690 --> 00:14:30.020
we learned about back in the Academy.

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:33.390
Perhaps this is a real 
paranormal event after all.

00:14:36.210 --> 00:14:38.100
Let's stop the ghost stories, okay?

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:41.840
I'm gonna solve this 
mystery once and for all.

00:14:41.840 --> 00:14:45.730
The narrator even said that summer
is the season for adventures!

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:47.790
You're not scared, Konohamaru?

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:49.120
Of course not!

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:50.470
He may have passed away,

00:14:50.470 --> 00:14:52.720
but the Third Hokage is still my grandpa!

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:56.490
I might get to see him again, 
and if he's sad I wanna help!

00:14:56.490 --> 00:15:00.380
Maybe the Third's ghost is 
trying to tell us something.

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:03.640
Seriously, enough with 
the ghost talk, guys.

00:15:03.640 --> 00:15:05.210
Actually...

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:07.570
Tsu-Tsu—

00:15:07.570 --> 00:15:08.720
Lady Tsunade?

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:10.510
I saw it myself last night.

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:12.980
I got up to go to the bathroom again,

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:15.810
And...

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:19.780
The Third's monument...

00:15:33.340 --> 00:15:34.910
What's wrong, Naruto?

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:37.220
The Third's eye... it moved...

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:38.000
What?!

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:41.620
Looks the same to me.

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:43.950
You're a real scaredy-cat, Naruto.

00:15:43.950 --> 00:15:46.870
I'm telling you, I saw it move!

00:15:46.870 --> 00:15:50.020
Yes, the eye certainly moved.

00:15:50.020 --> 00:15:53.600
But it was no paranormal event.

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:55.540
It was this man's doing!

00:15:55.540 --> 00:15:57.390
What are you doing here, anyway?

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:58.720
What does it look like?

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:02.160
Setting up a base on the 
edge of the Leaf Village.

00:16:02.550 --> 00:16:05.160
From here, I can observe 
Rock Lee and his ninja pals,

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:07.920
and attack the moment they 
let their guard down!

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:13.220
Whew, much better.

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:15.260
What?!

00:16:15.260 --> 00:16:18.700
The Hokage's tears are 
just toilet water?!

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:20.900
It's true, he's crying!

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:22.920
I told you so!

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:25.040
Could it be...

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:27.120
Hey!

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:28.740
Wait up!

00:16:28.740 --> 00:16:30.300
Where are you going?!

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:32.800
<i>Good luck.</i>

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:36.260
What is it, Lee?

00:16:39.960 --> 00:16:42.890
Maybe the Third Hokage's 
been watching my TV...

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:46.040
<i>I finally got to see Mubens's 
Elevation of the Boss...</i>

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:47.730
<i>That's it boy, keep wagging that tail—</i>

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:49.320
You're crazy!

00:16:50.680 --> 00:16:52.250
Quit messing around.

00:16:52.250 --> 00:16:53.150
Sorry.

00:16:53.480 --> 00:16:56.240
Anyways, let's go check 
out Mount Hokage.

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:02.160
I don't see anything unusual.

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:05.330
What?!

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:07.670
Now it's snot?!

00:17:08.150 --> 00:17:10.800
No, sorry, I'm just sweating a lot.

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:12.680
Again?!

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:14.250
I'm sorry!

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:17.610
Listen, I found something 
really amazing inside.

00:17:17.610 --> 00:17:18.510
Come take a look!

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:21.520
How the...?

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:23.350
Where did this cave come from?!

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:25.340
Hey, Naruto...

00:17:25.340 --> 00:17:26.190
What's up, Bushy—

00:17:29.520 --> 00:17:30.690
Stop it!

00:17:31.540 --> 00:17:35.850
Drat, my front-line base 
was almost complete...

00:17:35.850 --> 00:17:37.620
It's not finished?

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:38.870
Of course not!

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:45.460
Look at this place. I want a trendy
urban space, not a crude cave!

00:17:46.110 --> 00:17:49.380
A 37th floor penthouse, 
a beautiful night sky...

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:52.490
Top-class appliances 
and top-shelf wine.

00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:55.380
And of course, a robe made 
entirely of real silk!

00:17:55.640 --> 00:17:58.690
Lord Orochimaru, you're focusing 
on the wrong things...

00:17:58.690 --> 00:18:03.190
I'll just have to scare them off!

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:07.080
Konjac?

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:09.370
You got hit with konjac,

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:11.500
then you know what's coming next...

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:12.940
What?

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:15.190
A boiling bath, right?!

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:17.470
We're not a punishment game show!

00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:19.990
Well, that's no pot of oden.

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:24.050
There really is one?!

00:18:24.050 --> 00:18:24.910
I've got this.

00:18:25.350 --> 00:18:26.370
Byakugan!

00:18:30.970 --> 00:18:32.650
Noboribetsu Karls brand!

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:33.750
Bath salts?!

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:42.590
What the heck is this 
place, a haunted house?

00:18:42.590 --> 00:18:43.510
Seriously...

00:18:43.510 --> 00:18:45.510
Let's keep going.

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:52.970
Lord Orochimaru, only one of 
them was even remotely scared.

00:18:52.970 --> 00:18:54.380
Accursed brats.

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:57.190
I'll just have to use my secret weapon!

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:58.900
Take this!

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:02.870
What's this tape?

00:19:06.060 --> 00:19:09.740
I-Is that a video you only have
a week to watch...

00:19:09.740 --> 00:19:10.790
Yes.

00:19:10.950 --> 00:19:13.480
A week after watching it,

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:16.610
it starts accruing late fees 
if you don't return it.

00:19:16.610 --> 00:19:19.970
I rented it over three years ago
and completely forgot about it!

00:19:21.290 --> 00:19:23.790
There's no point in scaring yourself.

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:26.080
So are you going to be able 
to afford the late fees?

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:28.270
We already did this joke 
in the first part.

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:32.360
I wonder what's on it.

00:19:32.360 --> 00:19:34.070
Neji, if you please.

00:19:35.220 --> 00:19:36.400
Byakugan!

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:41.710
It's the Make-Out Tactics movie!

00:19:41.710 --> 00:19:44.330
The Byakugan can even 
see what's on tape?

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:46.630
You actually rented such a movie...

00:19:46.630 --> 00:19:49.660
Wait, that's the one I've 
wanted to see forever,

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:52.900
but the rental store always 
tells me it's checked out!

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:55.290
Lord Orochimaru, it was you!

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:58.420
That's enough.

00:19:58.420 --> 00:20:00.100
Wait, it was just getting good.

00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:01.660
We'll finish watching at my house.

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:03.510
You can't take it home!

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:06.560
This doesn't feel like much 
of a summer adventure.

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:08.190
No peeking!

00:20:08.860 --> 00:20:11.100
I'm down to my last option...

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:12.940
No more playing around!

00:20:17.700 --> 00:20:18.790
Shoot!

00:20:18.790 --> 00:20:20.480
Mr. Bushy-Brows!

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:23.490
Guys, are you okay?!

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:26.730
Konohamaru, go get Guy Sensei 
and the teachers!

00:20:26.730 --> 00:20:27.720
Got it!

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:29.870
Just hang tight, I'll be back soon!

00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:32.160
I think not.

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:34.000
You're behind this, aren't you?!

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:39.020
I may not even need to renovate 
my secret base now.

00:20:39.020 --> 00:20:40.550
You're all finished!

00:20:41.860 --> 00:20:43.420
No, lemme go!

00:20:43.420 --> 00:20:45.300
You've done it, Lord Orochimaru!

00:20:45.780 --> 00:20:47.290
Indeed!

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:49.220
What?

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:51.550
Huh?

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:52.730
Fireballs?

00:20:53.160 --> 00:20:55.690
I-I'm not doing this...

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:57.530
What is going on here?!

00:20:59.670 --> 00:21:00.650
<i>Grandpa?</i>

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:12.410
We're blasting off again!

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:15.540
Grandpa saved me...

00:21:18.170 --> 00:21:21.530
And so Orochimaru's plan was foiled.

00:21:24.830 --> 00:21:28.550
Perhaps spirits really exist after all.

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:31.550
<i>Keep watching me, Grandpa.</i>

00:21:31.550 --> 00:21:34.150
<i>I'll be Hokage one day!</i>

00:23:20.910 --> 00:23:23.880
We've been assigned student 
teaching positions!

00:23:23.880 --> 00:23:26.980
I can't wait to teach the 
students about ninjutsu!

00:23:26.980 --> 00:23:28.200
Student teaching?

00:23:28.200 --> 00:23:29.690
I'm sure we'll be fine,
 but I've got a bad feeling...

00:23:29.690 --> 00:23:30.970
Don't worry.

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:34.750
We'll just teach the kids everything 
we've learned ourselves.

00:23:34.750 --> 00:23:36.470
Yeah, I feel better now!

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:41.020
Next week is "Always Do Your 
Homework at the Last Minute!"

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:43.270
<b>Always Do Your Homework 
at the Last Minute!
Class 3-Lee! We Are Team Guy!</b>

00:23:41.020 --> 00:23:43.270
and "Class 3-Lee! We Are Team Guy!"

00:23:43.270 --> 00:23:46.070
Someone who says to "always do 
your homework at the last minute"

00:23:46.070 --> 00:23:48.680
being a teacher gives me 
that bad feeling again!
